{
  "caption": "Sydney演唱會結束後 趁著深夜的寧靜 走在無人的街道上 彷彿每走一步 都在重新回味今晚的美好 就讓回憶與感動 再多停留一會兒吧 After the Sydney concert, I wandered through the empty streets in the stillness of the night. With every step, it felt as though I was reliving the beautiful moments of the evening. Letting the memories and emotions linger just a little longer. \n#sydney",
